    {
      "id": "KZjNSbuCLVEfIBshMM4NA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2232.582389413022,
      "y": 485.4920026886962,
      "width": 378.9713134765625,
      "height": 156.65989111353238,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 987770329,
      "version": 2327,
      "versionNonce": 17604057,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785264132884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "como se que la version mala que conozco es la primer version mala?\n\nwhile l <= r {\n    if isBadVersion(N[m]) {\n        r = m - 1     \n    } else {\n        l = m + 1\n    }\n}\n\ntal vez no necesite saberlo, la busqueda binaria solita me\nposicionara en la primera version",
      "fontSize": 10.443992740902159,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "como se que la version mala que conozco es la primer version mala?\n\nwhile l <= r {\n    if isBadVersion(N[m]) {\n        r = m - 1     \n    } else {\n        l = m + 1\n    }\n}\n\ntal vez no necesite saberlo, la busqueda binaria solita me\nposicionara en la primera version",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
